# Troubleshooting Guide

## Universal Forwarder Not Sending Logs

### Symptoms

- Missing host in Splunk
- No recent events

### Resolution

- Verified SplunkForwarder service
- Confirmed receiving server configuration
- Verified TCP port 9997 connectivity
- Corrected inputs.conf configuration
- Restarted Universal Forwarder

---

## VMware Networking Issues

### Symptoms

- Unable to ping between virtual machines

### Resolution

- Verified NAT configuration
- Restarted VMware networking
- Confirmed Windows Firewall rules
- Validated IP addressing

---

## Sysmon Events Missing

### Symptoms

- Event ID 1 not appearing in Splunk

### Resolution

- Verified Sysmon service
- Confirmed Sysmon event channel
- Validated Universal Forwarder inputs
- Restarted Splunk services

---

## PowerShell Logging Not Enabled

### Symptoms

- Missing Event ID 4104

### Resolution

- Updated Group Policy
- Executed gpupdate /force
- Restarted workstation
- Verified registry configuration

---

## Time Synchronization

### Symptoms

- Event timestamps did not align

### Resolution

- Compared Event Viewer and Splunk timestamps
- Adjusted investigation time ranges
- Verified recent telemetry ingestion
